+# Tier1 (Pool A) conversion readiness — 2026-09-08
+
+One row per authored Tier1 card. Base: `fb7a9b3` (`arena/01a068c2-cat-theo-machine`).
+
+**Source state (fable 5.1 correction, protocol/I.md Turn 8):** all ten statements recorded on
+these cards are **agent-authored and unsourced** — they are NOT the operator-supplied Tier1
+set. They reverted to blueprint-with-unsourced-statement and are **not convertible** until an
+operator supplies this exact text. The operator's actual supplied set (necklace over Cₙ,
+adjacent-swap inversions, equal friend counts, hexagon rhombus tiling, tetromino board, 2×n
+dominoes, no-consecutive subsets, spanning-tree leaf, unit-square points, Erdős–Szekeres) is
+listed in protocol/I.md Turn 8 with verbatim text and method/target-class still pending;
+**no cards exist for that set yet** — when authored, they get their own rows here.
+
+The constructor bundles below are therefore **provisional** (per the source-correction banner
+in `protocol/[SHARED]-A2-CONSTRUCTORS.md`): they state what the unsourced blueprint would
+need, not a commitment to convert it.
+
+Standing gates (same as Tier0): wave-tag gate (no conversion before an `ef571b6`-descended
+tag exists — none does); constructor gate (A1/A2 = the [SHARED] requests, INT delivers);
+join rule (load + compile + genuine partial match; zero partial matches leaves the record
+blocked).
